{
  "id": "0042s_cisterna",
  "title": "Cebar con un camión cisterna",
  "caption": "¿Sabías que para cebar mate lo recomendable es un termo y no un camión cisterna de 30.000 litros? 🧉🚛\nSeguime para más datos de mate.",
  "hashtags": [
    "#mate",
    "#datoscuriosos",
    "#argentina",
    "#humor",
    "#sabiasque"
  ],
  "story": {
    "logline": "A \"did you know\" gag: for cebar, a one-litre termo is recommended, not a 30,000-litre water tanker; real numbers show how absurd it is, then the jet destroys yerba, bombilla and kitchen.",
    "timeline": [
      "One morning, about 10:00, sun; one continuous moment except the stadium cut-away (an illustration of the number)."
    ],
    "links": [
      "1 normal action -> 2 the absurd alternative arrives",
      "2 -> 3 its water temperature (real mate temperature)",
      "3 -> 4 its volume in cebadas (counter)",
      "4 -> 5 the number made tangible (stadium)",
      "5 -> 6 the hose is opened: consequence in three steps",
      "6 -> 7 result and call to action"
    ],
    "objects": [
      "termo: in Tomás' left hand until 6",
      "mate: right hand; full -> yerba blown out (6a) -> bombilla gone (6b) -> empty",
      "truck: arrives in 2, stays to the end",
      "walls: break in 6c, gone in 7"
    ],
    "facts": [
      "A typical termo holds about 1 litre.",
      "Water tankers commonly carry 20,000-30,000 litres.",
      "Mate water is best around 70-80 °C (boiling water burns the yerba).",
      "About 50 ml per cebada: 30,000 L / 0.05 L = 600,000 cebadas.",
      "Estadio Monumental (River Plate) holds about 84,000-85,000 people: 600,000 / 84,000 ≈ 7."
    ],
    "places": {
      "casita": "a small kitchen like a dollhouse (no front wall, no roof) on a lawn; street on the left; the truck parks along the left wall, its valve level with the window",
      "cancha": "the Monumental as a toy stadium, seen from above"
    }
  },
  "cast": {
    "vos": "Tomás, about 25, short dark hair, light blue shirt, beige trousers"
  },
